25300 The unchanged Conduit application compared in four platform/build combinations per paired page case. Measured 19,699-19,702M x86-64 Linux reference instructions on 2026-10-15 (PR #98), and since #443 the release optimiser's site cap is 1000, which measured 23,000M; this grant adds 10%. The owner re-granted it on 2026-10-15, replacing the 15,300M grant of 2026-10-14, which was sized from CPU time on a host without an instruction counter. Remove when the application builds fit the global budget, or when #423 deletes the direct cases.
